      {"label": "C", "text": "4"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "√34"}
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "切线垂直于过切点的半径，所以OA⊥PA。在直角三角形OAP中，PA=√(OP²-OA²)=√(25-9)=√16=4。",
    "hint": "切线⊥半径，用勾股定理。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
